          "detail": {
            "scope": "Fresh unauthenticated context; guest/preview disclosure observed before dismissing initial help.",
            "disclosure": "Taskbar Hero\n\nSTEP 1 OF 1 · NEW GAME\n\nChoose Your Class\n\nPick your cat's class! You can switch anytime outside boss fights.\n\nWarrior\nMELEE\n\nCleave: every 3rd swing also hits the next monster for 50%\n\nHP\n1x\nATK\n1x\nDEF\n1x\nAttack Speed:\n1.00s\nGuardian\nMELEE\n\nBonk: each hit delays target attack by 500 ms\n\nHP\n1.3x\nATK\n1.35x\nDEF\n1.3x\nAttack Speed:\n1.40s\nRogue\nMELEE\n\nTwin Strike: strikes 2 times per attack\n\nHP\n0.85x\nATK\n0.3x\nDEF\n0.85x\nAttack Speed:\n0.80s\nSTART ADVENTURE AS WARRIOR\n×\nHow to play\n1\nMochi the cat naps and plays on the strip, earning Fish and Yarn even while you're away (up to 8 h).\n2\nBeat the boss to earn one Cat Key per day (5 fights a day).\n3\nSpend Fish on gear upgrades in Inventory, and equip better drops.\n4\nForge a Relic with 30 Yarn and 1 Cat Key, and mint it to your wallet on Avalanche Fuji (free testnet, costs no real money).\n5\nTrade your minted Relics with other players in Market.\n\nDemo mode works without a wallet; sign in to save progress and mint Relics on the Avalanche Fuji testnet (free testnet, costs no real money). Wallet sign-in needs Chrome, Brave or Edge.\n\nSTART PLAYING"
